= form_with model: price, url: url, method: method, scope: :kilo_price, local: true, class: "adm-card space-y-6 p-4 sm:p-6" do |f|
  - if price.errors.any?
    .adm-card.p-4 style="border-color: var(--danger-200); background: var(--danger-100);"
      ul.list-inside.list-disc.text-sm style="color: var(--danger-700);"
        - price.errors.full_messages.each do |message|
          li= message

  .grid.grid-cols-1.md:grid-cols-2.gap-6
    .space-y-2
      = f.label :amount_euros, "Prix au kilo (€)", class: "adm-eyebrow block"
      = f.text_field :amount_euros, value: price.amount_euros, inputmode: "decimal", required: true, class: adm_field_class
    .space-y-2
      = f.label :active_from, "À partir du", class: "adm-eyebrow block"
      = f.date_field :active_from, required: true, class: adm_field_class
      p.text-xs style="color: var(--text-muted);" Le prix s'applique à partir de cette date incluse. Les périodes antérieures gardent le prix précédent.

  .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-end.gap-3
    = link_to "Annuler", owner_prices_path, class: adm_btn_class(:ghost)
    = f.submit submit_label, class: adm_btn_class(:primary, "cursor-pointer")
